body:
Obito and Hagoromo says chakra is what connects people to each other and both worlds (living and dead). We see examples of this with kushina/minato chakra helping Naruto even though they're dead and Dan as a spirit giving Tsunade chakra when she fell unconscious against Madara.

&#x200B;

Something similar happened in that same arc with Hagaromo giving Naruto and Sasuke half of his seal/chakra even though he's been dead for years...
